          "userName": "Michael Wong",
          "userRole": "User",
          "message": "Singapore Pools updates Toto results continuously, and Thursday’s draw will be independent of all past outcomes in a properly run game.​\nAny set of 6 numbers from 1–49 has the same probability \n1\n/\n(\n49\n6\n)\n1/( \n6\n49\n ), so “model picks” are just structured guesses derived from history, not genuine predictions.​\n\nDefine a concrete strategy",
